Subject: chrome/m156:[M156][graphite] Neutralize pending SkSL RP branches on
 failure and propagate SkTransformShader errors

* In SkSL::RP::Program::appendStages(), rewrite any already-appended branch contexts' offsets to +1 (fall-through) before returning false on early exit so that a partially populated pipeline cannot dispatch out of bounds if executed.
* In SkTransformShader::appendStages(), propagate the child shader's appendStages() return value instead of ignoring it and returning true, and mark SkShaderBase::appendStages() [[nodiscard]].
* Add regression tests in RasterPipelineCodeGeneratorTest and SkRuntimeEffectTest.

Bug: 574214629
Fixed: 579235370
Change-Id: I656059d09846ead72bbedc45c2a865fbdabfbb20
